    "detailed_description": "Embark on a hilarious journey where every step is a potential catastrophe. You're a lovable, yet <strong> Ridiculously Injury Prone</strong> character who, against all odds, must complete a series of mundane tasks for your mother. Whether you're taking a cake to grandma's house, helping Uncle Bob with the groceries, or personally delivering holiday cards, chaos is lurking around every corner.<br><br>The clock is ticking, and the pressure is on to deliver the goods without succumbing to a cascade of slapstick calamities. Timing, reflexes, and a touch of luck are your best friends as you strive to remain accident-free and complete each task unscathed. Just when you think you're in the clear, a new absurd challenge pops up, ready to send you flying into a world of comedic misfortune. <strong>RIP</strong>.<br><br>RIP: Ridiculously Injury Prone is currently in development. <br>Follow for updates!",
